# W8's j1 build alone (ADR-0110 item 2; CI's job for it, ADR-0213's
# Decision): /tests/w8.sh j1, with its check and recipe count. w8.script runs
# all five in one boot.
! -FAIL
! panicked
! ZORAYA-FAULT
< PSURF> 
> sh /tests/w8.sh j1\r
% boot
< W8-RECIPES w8-j1 72
< W8-OK w8-j1
% w8-j1
< W8-STATUS 0
< PSURF> 
> exit\r
< POSIX-STATS images=
< POSIX-CALLS
< BROKER-STATS
